OUTPUT LANGUAGE: Polish (pl)
TARGET DURATION: 15 seconds
NARRATION WORD RANGE: 21-33 words
TARGET NARRATION WORD COUNT: exactly 27 words if possible; never exceed the allowed range
EXACT SCENE COUNT: 5
EXACT TOTAL SHOT COUNT: 5

OUTPUT CONTRACT:
